== About Me

I am currently an Associate Professor at the School of Computer Science and Technology, Xi'an University of Science and Technology (XUST).

I received my dual bachelor's degrees in Mathematics and Applied Mathematics and Computer Application Technology from Northwest University in 2010, my master's degree in Computer Application Technology in 2013, and my Ph.D. degree in Computer Application Technology in 2018.

I joined Xi'an University of Science and Technology in June 2018 and was promoted to Associate Professor in January 2023.

My research interests mainly include IoT sensing, artificial intelligence, and crowd computing.

== Research Interests

- IoT Sensing
- Artificial Intelligence
- Crowd Computing
- Intelligent Sensing and Data Analytics

== Research

I have led or participated in more than ten government-funded research projects, including projects supported by the National Natural Science Foundation of China, the China Postdoctoral Science Foundation, the Department of Science and Technology of Shaanxi Province, and the Education Department of Shaanxi Province.

I have also participated in more than ten industry-funded research projects related to coal mines and research institutes.

== Publications

I have published more than 30 SCI-indexed papers in international journals, including /IEEE Transactions on Industrial Informatics/ and /IEEE Internet of Things Journal/. Two of these papers have been recognized as ESI Highly Cited Papers.

My research has also resulted in six accepted or granted invention patents.

[publications.html Publications]

== Awards

- *2024* — Second Prize of Science and Technology, China National Coal Association, for research on major coal-mine disaster risk monitoring, early warning, and collaborative safety management.
- *2023* — Third Prize of Science and Technology of Shaanxi Higher Education Institutions, for research on data-driven automatic image rendering based on deep neural networks.

== Academic Service

- Executive Committee Member, CCF Technical Committee on Internet of Things
- Executive Committee Member, CCF Technical Committee on Pervasive Computing

